      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just to add some detail, the order of audio sources is different in 2018 now than I had pictured here. The same problem still exists, I just didn't want anyone thinking my order was right in that screenshot. The order now is: \nFrontLeft, Front Right, Front Center, LowFreq, BackLeft, Back Right.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
